# never commit local secrets (API keys)
.env
.env.*
!.env.local.example

# SOTA solvers download standard torchvision/ImageNet inits at train time (network available in the
# agent/oracle env); the no-network verifier loads the agent's saved model, not these. So do NOT
# commit downloaded pretrained weights under solution/methods/**/weights/. The one non-torchvision
# checkpoint (PANN Cnn14, under freesound .../sota/assets/) IS shipped via git-lfs and is not ignored.
tasks/ai/mle/**/solution/methods/**/weights/
tasks/ai/post/**/solution/methods/**/weights/
